__Summary:__  Could lojban be used as a programming language? Has anything been done along those lines? If so, this is the page to collect that kind of information.

__Question:__  Is there more information that I haven't seen yet? if so, please enter  it here, or point me to it so I can enter it. -- ShaeErisson

__Bits:__  It seems that David Brookshire Conner has considered this subject in the most detail before I have.

__Rumors:__  Long ago I read about a minimal mapping done in Prolog, and at one point I even had it on disk, no idea if I still have it now.

